    "reconciliation": "the guard values track the census.  0.995794/0.963763/0.951561 are the invoiced-census values; 0.700/0.678/0.669 were computed from the raw realised census and must not be quoted as the invoiced ones.  If the residual census equals the invoiced census, the guards are the published values exactly"
  },
